---
title: Alamra Importers — Request Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Client Browser
    participant DNS as Cloudflare DNS
    participant CP as Cloudflare Pages
    participant CW as Cloudflare Worker
    participant CFr as AWS CloudFront
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
        Note over U,CP: Initial Page Load
        U ->>+ DNS : GET alamraimporters.com
        DNS ->>+ CP : Route to Cloudflare Pages
        CP -->>- DNS : HTML + JS + CSS bundle
        DNS -->>- U : Serve static site
    end

    rect rgb(252, 231, 243)
        Note over U,S3: Product Image Loading
        U ->>+ CFr : GET d194zinrjsggt.cloudfront.net/*.webp
        alt Cache HIT — Edge Node
            CFr -->> U : Return cached image
        else Cache MISS
            CFr ->>+ S3 : Fetch original from S3
            S3 -->>- CFr : Return image object
            CFr -->>- U : Serve image + set cache headers
        end
    end

    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)
        Note over U,CW: Contact Form Submission
        U ->>+ CW : POST /api/send-email
        Note right of U : Headers: X-Alamra-Secret
        CW ->> CW : Validate CORS origin + secret
        alt Valid Request
            CW ->> CW : Forward to Resend API
            CW -->> U : 200 OK — success: true
        else Invalid Request
            CW -->>- U : 403 Forbidden
        end
    end
